WEBVTT

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:14.010
What the...?

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:15.970
That thing was also a Gundam?

00:00:17.510 --> 00:00:18.430
Tiffa!

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:25.900
My fair princess, I shall save you.

00:00:36.030 --> 00:00:38.740
Stop that! She mustn't be moved!

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:48.500
Tiffa!

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.050
Mobile suit squad detected dead ahead!

00:00:59.550 --> 00:01:01.560
It worked perfectly, Brother.

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:07.100
That's my little brother. All that's left now is to finish them.

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:21.410
That looks bad!

00:01:21.740 --> 00:01:26.210
Twilight, eh? This might be the ideal time for them to die.

00:01:29.250 --> 00:01:32.050
Go to hell before you get a chance to see the Moon.

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:46.890
<b>After War</b>

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:46.890
<b>GUNDAM</b>

00:01:46.890 --> 00:01:54.400
<b>The dream I'd nearly forgotten is beginning to stir,</b>

00:01:54.400 --> 00:01:57.360
<b>little by little</b>

00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:01.910
<b>filling in the gaps in my heart.</b>

00:02:01.910 --> 00:02:09.290
<b>The instant my frozen memories begin to awaken,</b>

00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:18.800
<b>my only wish is for the future that is about to begin.</b>

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:22.350
<b>I'll reach out with both hands</b>

00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:26.350
<b>and embrace that dream I once had.</b>

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:29.980
<b>I want to go on believing</b>

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:33.900
<b>without ever letting go or giving up.</b>

00:02:33.900 --> 00:02:37.530
<b>Until the day comes when I grab hold...</b>

00:02:37.530 --> 00:02:41.410
<b>...of that dream I once had,</b>

00:02:41.410 --> 00:02:44.950
<b>I want to keep chasing after it</b>

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:50.830
<b>without ever forgetting my hopes and dreams.</b>

00:02:55.460 --> 00:03:01.680
<b>Episode 5</b>

00:02:55.460 --> 00:03:01.680
<b>"You Pull the Trigger"</b>

00:03:03.010 --> 00:03:03.850
Take evasive!

00:03:03.890 --> 00:03:05.010
Roger that!

00:03:10.850 --> 00:03:12.020
We're hit!

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:17.280
Freeden! Are you all right?

00:03:17.280 --> 00:03:18.990
Our main engine's been hit.

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:21.070
Cover the Freeden!

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:23.110
Launch mobile suits!

00:03:32.830 --> 00:03:35.330
They've launched mobile suits, Brother.

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:40.510
But not the Gundam-type, I see... Olba, take Tiffa to the lab.

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:43.010
Understood, Brother.

00:03:46.850 --> 00:03:49.470
So... Let's begin, shall we?

00:04:07.990 --> 00:04:08.870
Wait!

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:12.000
What do you think you're doing?

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:15.210
Isn't it obvious? I'm going out in this Gundam!

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:17.540
The GX won't work without this.

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:19.670
Give me that!

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:23.550
We're dealing with Gundams of unknown origin.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:25.090
We have a Gundam, too!

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:27.800
We can't use the Satellite Cannon right now.

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:29.260
I know that!

00:04:29.350 --> 00:04:31.350
One mistake will cost you your life.

00:04:31.470 --> 00:04:33.140
My life's always been on the line!

00:04:33.600 --> 00:04:35.480
Why do you fight, then?

00:04:36.690 --> 00:04:38.730
What are you fighting for?!

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:44.110
Well, I... Um, for Newtypes... Their...

00:04:44.240 --> 00:04:45.910
This is so annoying!

00:04:46.030 --> 00:04:50.700
No, not for them! I want to save Tiffa!

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.830
I'm in love with her, so I have to!

00:04:56.080 --> 00:04:58.380
Who comes right out and says it like that?

00:05:03.170 --> 00:05:05.010
Bring Tiffa back.

00:05:10.350 --> 00:05:12.720
Is it a good idea to leave this up to a kid like him?

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:15.940
He's rough around the edges, but he has the right stuff.

00:05:16.020 --> 00:05:18.480
He's a far better choice than I am with my cockpit phobia.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:20.980
Is he gonna be okay, though?

00:05:21.110 --> 00:05:24.780
I mean, he seems kind of like an idiot.

00:05:29.240 --> 00:05:31.120
Gundam, heading out!

00:05:31.870 --> 00:05:35.620
Don't forget your rifle! And take the Shoulder Vulcan, too!

00:05:42.710 --> 00:05:44.260
I'm coming, Tiffa!

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:52.010
What?!

00:05:56.180 --> 00:06:00.560
It was a mistake to come out before moonrise, GX.

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:07.780
He's fast!

00:06:11.490 --> 00:06:14.660
Come on, this is totally one-sided!

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:17.080
The Captain's sickness must really be-

00:06:17.660 --> 00:06:19.080
Darn it...

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:20.500
C-Can it!

00:06:20.830 --> 00:06:23.090
What? Don't interrupt me!

00:06:23.210 --> 00:06:24.340
C-Captain?!

00:06:24.880 --> 00:06:27.170
Who's piloting the Gundam, then?

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:29.680
It's not that Garrod kid, is it?

00:06:31.180 --> 00:06:32.140
It is.

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:39.310
Crap!

00:06:42.520 --> 00:06:43.940
Who do you think you are?!

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:58.500
Goodbye, GX.

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.010
I'm just getting warmed up!

00:07:12.550 --> 00:07:15.810
I was that bullheaded once...

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.740
He says he has the room reserved until morning! Let's party it up!

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:38.540
Hey, where'd the star of the party go?

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:40.910
Where's my Roabea?

00:08:08.440 --> 00:08:09.940
Down you go!

00:08:14.820 --> 00:08:16.740
Tough it out a little longer.

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:19.830
When I've earned a little more, I'll go get you guys.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:50.480
I've administered APM. Begin treatment immediately.

00:08:50.570 --> 00:08:51.610
Understood!

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:54.610
Ah, you must be Olba Frost.

00:08:54.740 --> 00:08:59.580
Yes. I've brought you Tiffa Adill, just as my brother promised.

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:01.330
Indeed.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:03.080
I'll be leaving, then.

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:07.710
I'll assist my brother in mopping up those Vultures.

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:20.140
Mopping up, eh? You're right, one must be diligent in cleaning up one's messes.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:29.190
Hit him! Hit him!

00:09:31.860 --> 00:09:33.820
M-My rifle's out of energy?

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:36.200
Amateur.

00:09:57.680 --> 00:10:00.930
Always keep your trump card in reserve until the last minute.

00:10:03.810 --> 00:10:05.350
Don't interfere.

00:10:11.730 --> 00:10:13.820
What?! That was just one blast?!

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:15.530
A scattershot beam cannon!

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:17.030
Is that thing a monster?

00:10:17.110 --> 00:10:19.450
As I said, don't interfere.

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:25.740
I'm not gonna die here!

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.080
I-Isn't he in a little trouble?

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.210
No, he's in a lot of trouble!

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:33.170
Calculate time remaining until moonrise!

00:10:33.250 --> 00:10:34.210
Yes, sir!

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:40.930
Have you completed the antidote treatment?

00:10:41.010 --> 00:10:43.970
Yes, sir. She'll wake up soon.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:47.640
Good. All that's left now is to eliminate that scum.

00:10:51.900 --> 00:10:54.440
Captain, moonrise is in ten minutes, thirty seconds.

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:56.610
Ten minutes, thirty seconds...

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:05.620
What's the matter, GX?

00:11:05.660 --> 00:11:08.120
You were supposed to be the most powerful Gundam.

00:11:17.710 --> 00:11:18.420
What?!

00:11:21.800 --> 00:11:24.300
I didn't come at a bad time, did I?

00:11:24.800 --> 00:11:27.680
No. I'm glad you're back, Olba.

00:11:27.720 --> 00:11:30.890
I wanted to take down that Gundam with you.

00:11:36.770 --> 00:11:40.900
I'm not gonna die, not until I rescue Tiffa...

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:42.240
Mark my words!

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:08.810
I'll make the first move, Brother.

00:12:09.260 --> 00:12:10.100
Roger.

00:12:11.810 --> 00:12:12.690
Here he comes!

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:24.610
Eat this!

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:27.070
Brother!

00:12:49.890 --> 00:12:50.810
Crap!

00:12:56.230 --> 00:12:58.810
Now, Brother. Finish him.

00:12:59.060 --> 00:13:03.070
Let's bring back the GX. I'll just kill the pilot.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:11.490
It truly is goodbye this time, GX.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:18.670
What?!

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:20.710
Brother!

00:13:26.090 --> 00:13:27.930
Witz! Roabea!

00:13:28.180 --> 00:13:30.510
You're all over the place.

00:13:31.640 --> 00:13:33.970
That's why you're such a little kid.

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:36.980
You guys! You came back!

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:38.150
Shut up.

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:40.900
Call it post-sale service.

00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:43.980
Those two aren't so bad after all!

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:45.610
I suppose not.

00:13:54.080 --> 00:13:57.080
Are you awake, Tiffa Adill?

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:05.010
What are you so afraid of?

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:16.100
Tiffa, this postwar world is looking for reformation.

00:14:20.850 --> 00:14:24.270
For that, we must understand your power.

00:14:24.400 --> 00:14:29.360
We must ascertain whether or not you are a genuine Newtype.

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:32.280
H-Help me...

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:34.950
It is you who will help us.

00:14:35.410 --> 00:14:38.620
Your power will save the postwar world.

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:43.790
Mr. Chairman! The Grandeene has arrived!

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:47.210
Very well. I'll be right there.

00:14:58.480 --> 00:15:00.310
So this is the Grandeene...

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:04.900
Yes, sir. It's a mobile armor that was used by the old Space Revolutionary Army's drop squads.

00:15:05.400 --> 00:15:09.150
It has a charged particle starburst cannon for ultra-long range attacks.

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:11.360
Get it ready at once.

00:15:11.410 --> 00:15:12.280
Yes, sir! Yes, sir!

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:18.700
With Tiffa Adill back, I have no need for those mobile suit pilots.

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:22.250
I'll use the Grandeene to eliminate them along with the Vultures!

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:41.310
Energy charge, 93%!

00:15:41.390 --> 00:15:44.190
Trajectory correction! Angle of elevation, 0.125!

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:46.060
Safety lock released!

00:15:46.690 --> 00:15:49.230
You have a precise read on their position?

00:15:49.320 --> 00:15:52.740
The mobile suit squad that went with them sent up a signal flare.

00:15:52.860 --> 00:15:54.280
Very well. Do it.

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:07.710
We're... in danger here.

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:09.340
Tiffa?

00:16:09.590 --> 00:16:11.510
Intense heat source closing in fast!

00:16:14.380 --> 00:16:15.340
What the...?

00:16:27.860 --> 00:16:30.480
Brother! That was a charged particle starburst cannon!

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:35.360
I can see that. It looks like we were too quick to hand over Tiffa.

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:44.330
Hurry, get the ship moving! We're in danger if we sit still!

00:16:47.790 --> 00:16:49.040
What the hell's going on?

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:51.880
Must be a long-range attack from the lab.

00:16:52.380 --> 00:16:56.390
Maybe they want to reduce this whole area to cinders.

00:16:56.470 --> 00:16:58.260
Those people are nuts!

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:05.310
Crap, what the heck should we do?

00:17:05.940 --> 00:17:08.560
Captain! Three minutes to moonrise!

00:17:08.980 --> 00:17:13.740
Hey, that's right! The Satellite Cannon would be able to hit the lab from here!

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:17.320
But if we do that, we'll also kill that Tiffa girl!

00:17:17.410 --> 00:17:19.410
What do you suggest we do, then?!

00:17:26.710 --> 00:17:28.000
Work together?

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:34.420
Yes, of course... I understand!

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:37.880
Captain!

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:47.600
Fire! Keep firing!

00:17:52.230 --> 00:17:54.030
Crap! They're gonna hit us before long!

00:17:58.280 --> 00:17:59.410
Jamil!

00:18:01.740 --> 00:18:03.160
What are you doing?!

00:18:03.660 --> 00:18:05.580
I need your help, Garrod!

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:12.710
Use psychic messages from Tiffa to aim the Satellite Cannon?

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:14.170
That's right.

00:18:14.250 --> 00:18:17.420
Is that even possible?! Besides, if-

00:18:17.470 --> 00:18:22.220
If we fail, Tiffa will die. But this is the only way.

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:25.680
I wish I could take the shot myself, but as you can see...

00:18:26.310 --> 00:18:28.350
My hand won't stop shaking.

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:30.600
I'll be the target spotter.

00:18:30.690 --> 00:18:33.520
You pull the trigger.

00:18:33.980 --> 00:18:36.740
All right, I'll trust you.

00:18:46.370 --> 00:18:49.210
It'll throw off the position if you move, so stay put until we fire.

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:52.880
I'll stay put even if it kills me. So, where do I aim?

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:53.790
Hold on.

00:18:59.010 --> 00:19:02.840
What's wrong with him? Is he trying to make himself a sitting duck?

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:05.850
Hang on, is he gonna shoot at the lab from here?

00:19:10.060 --> 00:19:13.730
Time until Satellite Cannon can be fired, 30 seconds!

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:24.830
Firing angle adjustments... Raise angle of elevation 2.3...

00:19:29.500 --> 00:19:31.880
Horizontally, left-

00:19:32.370 --> 00:19:33.080
Jamil!

00:19:33.130 --> 00:19:34.080
I'm fine!

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:37.500
Horizontally, left 4.15...

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:43.510
Targeting laser has clear line of sight!

00:19:54.350 --> 00:19:55.560
Don't move!

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.110
GX!

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:58.730
We're going to kill you!

00:20:02.570 --> 00:20:03.280
Brother!

00:20:05.120 --> 00:20:08.290
Hey! Don't forget about us!

00:20:10.910 --> 00:20:13.370
Beat it, you weirdo Gundams!

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:17.630
Microwave incoming!

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:38.900
Recharging complete. Commencing second barrage.

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:41.280
Once the interlopers are gone,

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:45.490
I can solve the riddle of Newtype powers at my leisure.

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:28.280
Tiffa!

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:29.740
Tiffa!

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:33.910
Ow! Ouch, ouch, ouch...

00:21:38.630 --> 00:21:40.500
Come on, let's go home.

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:41.800
Home?

00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:42.500
Yeah!

00:21:43.000 --> 00:21:45.130
Back to Jamil. Okay?

00:22:00.690 --> 00:22:03.480
And so, morning came and it was time to part ways.

00:22:04.230 --> 00:22:07.150
When they meet next, will they be friend or foe?

00:22:07.280 --> 00:22:10.280
Or will they even meet again in this life?

00:22:11.280 --> 00:22:13.540
No one knows the answers to those questions.

00:22:13.990 --> 00:22:18.160
People call them Vultures after the carrion-eating birds.

00:22:21.080 --> 00:22:26.590
But like everyone, they are doing their best to get by in these postwar times.

00:22:46.360 --> 00:22:51.660
<b>Can I find the words to tell you</b>

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:52.450
Garrod has always lived alone, so group life aboard the Freeden is difficult.

00:22:51.660 --> 00:22:57.040
<b>How I live between the walls of steel and stone</b>

00:22:52.450 --> 00:22:56.160
He is also losing his confidence around Tiffa.

00:22:56.160 --> 00:22:59.440
His emotional rashness causes another crisis.

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:04.880
<b>How I close my eyes to find some kind of rapture</b>

00:23:05.590 --> 00:23:11.220
<b>In a world where you can feel so all alone</b>

00:23:12.890 --> 00:23:18.220
<b>Inside I'm full of light and laughter</b>

00:23:19.680 --> 00:23:22.100
<b>There's a flame that burns in me</b>

00:23:22.100 --> 00:23:23.060
<b>(I need a way)</b>

00:23:23.060 --> 00:23:27.150
<b>(I need a way) I need a way to set it free</b>

00:23:27.150 --> 00:23:32.070
<b>When you find love in your heart</b>

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:34.200
<b>(The human touch)</b>

00:23:34.200 --> 00:23:38.240
<b>You can believe from the start</b>

00:23:38.240 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>(From the start)</b>

00:23:41.160 --> 00:23:43.380
<b>Dreams they come true</b>

00:23:43.380 --> 00:23:44.750
<b>(They come true)</b>

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:49.090
<b>All comes to you, oh all at once</b>

00:23:49.090 --> 00:23:52.880
<b>If you believe in human touch</b>

00:23:50.720 --> 00:23:51.930
It's offensive.

00:23:51.930 --> 00:23:57.100
<b>Episode 6</b>

00:23:51.930 --> 00:23:57.100
<b>"It's Offensive"</b>

00:23:57.100 --> 00:23:59.100
<b></b>
